          "text": "{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For January 8, the Turkish Airlines business-cabin award via Los Angeles is one option, arriving in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. on January 10. It arrives earlier than the later-arriving business award, but another shown award reaches Bangkok at the same time with a slightly shorter reported elapsed time. All three require a separate SFO–LAX ticket; award-seat availability and taxes are not reliably reported.\"}]},{\"start\":2,\"end\":4,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If you prefer a later SFO departure on Alaska, the other early-arriving business-award option leaves at 8:40 a.m. rather than 8:36 a.m. and has a reported elapsed time four minutes shorter, while arriving at the same time. You give up the four-minute-earlier departure on American; the LAX wait is the same, and both use the same reported award routing.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J75@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Same early arrival, later SFO departure\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 8:40 a.m. on Alaska to LAX, then uses the Turkish Airlines business-cabin award via Istanbul, arriving at 4:15 a.m. January 10. The award is reported at 275,000 Turkish-program points; individual-leg cabins are not supplied. Reported elapsed time is four minutes shorter than the American-feeder option, with the same arrival time and LAX wait. Taxes and reliable award-seat availability are unknown, and separate-ticket protection and bookability are unverified.\"}]},{\"start\":4,\"end\":6,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"If you would rather have a longer Istanbul connection, the later-arriving business-award option has a seven-hour wait there, compared with 2 hours 20 minutes on the early-arriving awards. It shares the 8:40 a.m. SFO departure and 2-hour-29-minute LAX wait with the Alaska-feeder option, but arrives 4 hours 35 minutes later. You would trade the earlier Bangkok arrival and shorter overall trip for that longer Istanbul connection.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J115@2027-01-08T08:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Later-arriving business award\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 8:40 a.m. on Alaska to LAX, then flies Turkish Airlines via Istanbul to Bangkok, arriving at 8:50 a.m. January 10. The award portion is reported as business cabin at 275,000 Turkish-program points, with individual-leg cabins not supplied. The LAX wait between separate bookings is 2 hours 29 minutes; the Istanbul connection is 7 hours. Taxes and a reliable award-seat count are unavailable, and separate-ticket protection and booking feasibility are unverified.\"}]}]}",
